 {"id": 867092, "date": 1038528000, "platform": 8, "y": 2002, "release_region": {"id": 1, "region": "europe"}}, {"id": 867093, "date": 1037664000, "platform": 8, "y": 2002, "release_region": {"id": 2, "region": "north_america"}}, {"id": 867094, "date": 1032393600, "platform": 8, "y": 2002, "release_region": {"id": 5, "region": "japan"}}, {"id": 867095, "date": 1032393600, "platform": 11, "y": 2002, "release_region": {"id": 5, "region": "japan"}}, {"id": 867096, "date": 1038528000, "platform": 11, "y": 2002, "release_region": {"id": 1, "region": "europe"}}, {"id": 867097, "date": 1048982400, "platform": 11, "y": 2003, "release_region": {"id": 2, "region": "north_america"}}, {"id": 920278, "date": 957139200, "platform": 52, "y": 2000, "release_region": {"id": 2, "region": "north_america"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 386074, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc89wa.jpg"}, {"id": 386070, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc89w6.jpg"}, {"id": 386075, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc89wb.jpg"}, {"id": 386072, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc89w8.jpg"}, {"id": 386073, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc89w9.jpg"}, {"id": 386071, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc89w7.jpg"}], "slug": "marvel-vs-capcom-2-new-age-of-heroes", "storyline": "Two years after the battle against Onslaught, peace in the planet Earth was restored until a mysterious entity named Abyss, shrouded the atmosphere with his dark energy. It was consumed within a sphere that the being was holding close to him; With his immense strength, it blew passed a desert and the plant life was also ruined. A pirate known as Ruby Heart discovered the energy and warned the heroes and villains from the two camps who were fighting amongst themselves. Together, they must stop this new nemesis before the Earth and the universe is destroyed by Abyss' terrible power. In the end of the battle, the heroes and villains make a truce while taking a joy cruise on Ruby Heart's ship flying through the skies of the Earth; She holds the orb in her hand then casts it into the sea thus seeing the last of Abyss and closing the rivalry between Marvel and Capcom.", "summary": "Marvel vs. Capcom 2: New Age of Heroes is the fourth game in the Marvel vs. Capcom series of fighting games. The player's controls were simplified to make the gameplay more accessible to the wider audience of casual players and the button configuration was trimmed down to 4 main buttons and 2 assist buttons. The game also features a different air-combo system and 3 on 3 tag, compared to the 2 on 2 tag from previous games in the series.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/marvel-vs-capcom-2-new-age-of-heroes", "videos": [{"id": 36499, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "o14YPG0c5hk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o14YPG0c5hk", "title": "Marvel Vs. Capcom 2 playthrough (Dreamcast) (1CC)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/o14YPG0c5hk/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 64476, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "-MarHk64UR0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-MarHk64UR0", "title": "Marvel vs Capcom 2 Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-MarHk64UR0/hqdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 1104, "name": "Marvel vs. Capcom"}, {"id": 3746, "name": "Capcom Versus"}]}